# Database & Services Architecture Guide

## Core Architecture Components

This project uses a sophisticated multi-layered database architecture combining:

- **PGlite**: Client-side PostgreSQL with live query capabilities
- **TypeORM**: Type-safe ORM with custom PGlite integration
- **Jotai**: Atomic state management for granular reactivity
- **Live Queries**: 3 different strategies for real-time data sync
- **Domain Services**: Clean separation of business logic

